		(property "Description" "PhotoMOS relay (photorelay), 1-Form-A, 400mA/60V, SOP-4 (2.54SOP4), Toshiba TLP172A(TP,F). Pin map verified against the Toshiba official datasheet (2025-08-22, Rev.2.0) Figure 4.1 Pin Assignment: 1=Anode, 2=Cathode, 3=Drain, 4=Drain (the device is a back-to-back dual-MOSFET AC switch -- both output pins are genuinely named Drain in the datasheet, no source/polarity distinction; Note 1 confirms pins 3/4 are shorted for the 2-terminal isolation-voltage test). The easyeda2kicad pull (LCSC C99477) independently produced the same A/C/D/D map -- cross-verified. Used as the RJ-11 ALARM_OUT isolated dry-contact driver (BOM-C sec-I/O, sheet 08a)."
			(at -1.27 0 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
