		)
		(property "Description" "Dual low-offset-voltage comparator, open-collector outputs, SOIC-8, onsemi LM393DR2G. Pin map verified against the onsemi LM393/D datasheet (Rev.34, Sept 2025) PIN CONNECTIONS top-view diagram plus the standard industry LM393/LM339-family pinout: 1=Output A, 2=Inputs A (inverting), 3=Inputs A (non-inverting), 4=GND, 5=Inputs B (non-inverting), 6=Inputs B (inverting), 7=Output B, 8=VCC. Outputs typed open_collector per the datasheet (Output Short Circuit-to-Ground rating, no internal pull-up -- needs an external pull-up resistor). Used as the RJ-11 EOL-loop window-compare (BOM-C sec-I/O, sheet 08a)."
			(at 0 -1.27 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
